OL,3,GNEWSAMinister open to grant for fourth 
OL,4,ABergerac series                        
OL,6,FJersey's government is "supportive" of 
OL,7,Fawarding a grant towards filming the   
OL,8,Flatest series of Bergerac.             
OL,10,FMinister for Sustainable Development   
OL,11,Fdeputy Gerald Voisin said "in          
OL,12,Fprinciple" he backed Visit Jersey and  
OL,13,Fthe government supporting a fourth     
OL,14,Fseries of the detective drama reboot.  
OL,16,FThe government has already given more  
OL,17,Fthan #700,000 in grants to the crime   
OL,18,Fseries which is due to resume filming  
OL,19,Fin 2027, with #1.5m spent over series  
OL,20,Fone and two.                           
